106
00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.150 line:15%
I'm always trying to break things down.

107
00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.830 line:15%
So as I'm watching, I'm breaking it down.

108
00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.450 line:15%
But then once I have those ideas

109
00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.460 line:15%
