110
00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.650 line:15%
I also put myself in their shoes.

111
00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:30.540
I was a contestant on a singing show.

112
00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.210
You gotta wrap it up in a nice way,

113
00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.800
