114
00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.530
in a way that doesn't throw them off guard,

115
00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:37.750
in a way that feels helpful.

116
00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.900
So I think it's using that empathy with the analyzation.

117
00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.170
That's the process.

118
00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.520
You know, the other thing is that we had some real talent

119
00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:47.820
