153
00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:13.980
We actually, we were in New York on September 7th of 2000...

154
00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:15.600
Oh, really?
Yeah.

155
00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:18.360
And we were stranded outside of Boston

156
00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:19.620
